# Teleport STAGING policy verification root -- PUBLIC half.
#
# The staging environment owns its own root, distinct from dev's. That is the
# point: a dev root leak must not be able to forge staging policy, and dev's
# private half is deliberately committed in the fairyland repo -- so sharing it
# with staging would have made "anyone who can read the repo" a valid signer for
# a real deployment. An earlier plan (2026-08-12, alongside the Aliyun KMS
# retirement) did propose reusing the dev root; it was reversed on 2026-08-13.
#
# PRIVATE half: lives ONLY server-side, in the fairyland repo, BYOK-imported into
# the staging OpenBao Transit key `teleport-root`. It is deliberately NOT copied
# into this repo -- the client verifies signatures and therefore needs nothing
# but the public half.
#
# SHA-256(DER SubjectPublicKeyInfo):
#   8b06e78bf12ff0f7c4250c1ffbb773ec713d92d3936171163b1a327a597f2577
# kPolicyVerificationKeyHash: 1:8b06e78bf12ff0f7
# Source: fairyland spec/aliyun-first-deploy commit 66bd983; delivered as PEM
# text in FAIRYLAND-T6-SYNC.md and verified byte-for-byte on import.
# Imported: 2026-08-13.
